message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "ST-GCN-LSTM daily crime count prediction for Chicago census tracts"
abstract: >-
  Notebook and recorded results for daily crime count regression across 878 Chicago
  census tracts. The ST-GCN-LSTM model combines a graph attention network over a
  k-nearest-neighbour tract graph with a bidirectional LSTM, and is compared with GCN,
  LSTM, CNN and CNN+LSTM baselines.
authors:
